  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then number of solutions of the given equation when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is ________."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math> (reject)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> only</p><p>Hence, only one solution.</p>"
  }
